 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the current browser to receive the user's tray notifications. A user can only register a subscription for themselves.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/123",
+    "p256dh_key": "browser-public-key",
+    "auth_key": "browser-auth-secret"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` for a new browser subscription or `200 OK` when refreshing an existing subscription.
