 ```
 
+#### Push notifications
+
+To let people enable push notifications on their phones and computers, create a VAPID key pair:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=#{key.public_key}", "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=#{key.private_key}"'
+```
+
+Set the two generated values as `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` in the container environment. Keep the private key secret and the pair stable and backed up. Replacing it invalidates existing browser subscriptions. Push notifications require HTTPS (except when developing on localhost).
+
 #### S3 storage (optional)
 
 If you'd prefer that uploaded files were stored in an S3 bucket rather than in your mounted volume, you can set that up.
